| s / 2 | unavailable | unavailable | old | unavailable | [abc](#configuration-abc) | completed | 12 | 2 | unavailable | unavailable |
| next / 1 | unavailable | unavailable | new | unavailable | [abc](#configuration-abc) | completed | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |

